1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:03,399
You're not born with self-control. You build it.

2
00:00:04,749 --> 00:00:09,613
Most people think some people just have willpower, and others don't. That's a myth.

3
00:00:10,863 --> 00:00:16,368
Waiting is a skill, like riding a bike. Wobbly at first, then easier every time.

4
00:00:17,618 --> 00:00:22,099
Every time you wait, even a little, you get a rep. And small reps add up.

5
00:00:23,349 --> 00:00:27,422
So start tiny. Wait ten seconds. Then one minute. Then ten.

6
00:00:28,772 --> 00:00:32,687
What's one thing you'll practice waiting for this week? Tell me in the comments.

7
00:00:34,337 --> 00:00:37,229
Follow me for more delayed gratification tips.

